{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14034","headline":"得替後书怀上第五相公 · 耿湋","name":"得替後书怀上第五相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁语恓惶客，偏承顾盼私。\n应逾骨肉分，敢忘死生期。\n山县唯荒垒，云屯尽老师。\n庖人宁自代，食蘖谬相推。\n黄绶名空罢，青春鬓又衰。\n还来扫门处，犹未报恩时。\n独立花飞满，无言月下迟。\n不知丞相意，更欲遣何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}